      <p>When it comes to navigating the complex world of criminal law, having the right legal representation is paramount. If you're in Chennai and facing legal troubles, the Rajendra Criminal Law Firm is one name that should be on your radar.</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-navy mt-8">Understanding Criminal Law in Chennai</h2>
      <p>Criminal law governs offenses against society under Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita 2023 (BNS). Chennai's jurisdiction falls under Madras High Court and various district courts. Criminal proceedings follow Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita 2023 (BNSS) procedural guidelines.</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-navy mt-8">Types of Criminal Offenses Handled</h2>
      <p>Rajendra Criminal Law Firm specializes in diverse criminal matters under BNS 2023, including theft, robbery, murder charges, white-collar crimes, cybercrime, domestic violence, and dowry harassment complaints.</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
        <li>Murder and culpable homicide cases</li>
        <li>Economic offenses and financial frauds</li>
        <li>Sexual assault and POCSO Act matters</li>
        <li>Narcotic drugs and psychotropic substances cases</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-navy text-cream px-6 py-3 rounded-sm">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
